> how do you bless water?
>or use an altar to uncurse something?

Spoilers, obviously:


To bless water (making it into holy water) you need to drop it on
a coaligned altar and then pray while standing on that altar.  Your
God must be happy with you first; sacrifice stuff on the altar
until you get friendly-sounding messages.

You can't use an altar to uncurse things.  You can use holy water,
fountains (with luck), praying (sometimes), scrolls of remove curse
(especially blessed ones), and a few other methods.

